  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The moment of inertia of the system about the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi>M</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>d</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>13</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>The moment of inertia of the system about the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi>M</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>d</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi>M</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>23</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>So, the ratio&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>13</mn><mn>23</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
